    <h1>Privacy Policy for TriPlan</h1>
    <span class="badge">Last updated: November 05, 2026</span>
    
    <p>Welcome to <strong>TriPlan</strong> ("we," "our," or "us"). We are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring your personal information is handled in a safe and responsible manner. This Privacy Policy explains how information is collected, used, and safeguarded when you use our mobile application <strong>TriPlan</strong>.</p>
    
    <p>By using the app, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy.</p>

    <hr>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>TriPlan is designed to prioritize user privacy and minimize data collection. We collect only what is strictly necessary to provide our travel and planning services:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Account & Profile Information:</strong> If you choose to register or log in, we may collect basic details such as your name and email address to manage your account.</li>
      <li><strong>Travel Preferences & Itinerary Data:</strong> Information you enter while planning your trips (destinations, dates, trip companions, budget values, and travel notes).</li>
      <li><strong>Expense Tracking Data:</strong> Travel expenses and budget logs entered via the MiniNote feature are stored locally on your device unless cloud sync is explicitly enabled.</li>
      <li><strong>Travel Stories & Experiences:</strong> Any content, travel feedback, or photos you voluntarily submit in the "Travel Experiences" community section.</li>
      <li><strong>Location Information (Optional):</strong> We may request access to your device's approximate or precise location (GPS) solely to calculate distances, show nearby attractions, and assist with route navigation. We do not track your location in the background.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use the collected information for the following purposes:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>To create and manage your user account.</li>
      <li>To generate personalized travel itineraries and route directions.</li>
      <li>To maintain your trip budget and local expense records.</li>
      <li>To display community travel experiences and reviews.</li>
      <li>To maintain, debug, and optimize app performance and user experience.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Local Storage & Data Security</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Local Storage:</strong> Your expense records and draft itineraries are saved locally on your device via secure device storage.</li>
      <li><strong>Data Security:</strong> We employ standard commercial safeguards to protect your information against unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure. However, no electronic storage or transmission method over the internet is 100% secure.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Third-Party Services & Links</h2>
    <p>TriPlan may integrate or provide links to third-party services for enriched travel features (such as Google Maps SDK for route display, or booking partner links like Booking.com / MakeMyTrip). These third parties have their own independent privacy policies, and we are not responsible for their practices.</p>

    <h2>5. Data Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
    <p>We <strong>do not</strong> sell, trade, rent, or lease your personal identification information to third parties. We may disclose information only if required by law or to protect public safety.</p>

    <h2>6. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>TriPlan is not intended for use by children under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal data from children under 13.</p>

    <h2>7. User Data Rights & Deletion</h2>
    <p>You can clear locally stored trip plans and expenses anytime by clearing app data or uninstalling the app. You may also contact us to request permanent deletion of your account.</p>

    <h2>8. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update our Privacy Policy periodically. Any changes will become effective immediately upon posting to this page.</p>

